| 9           | 1292             |
| 10          | 1138             |

Genres (item_name, item_value, resource_requirement):

| item_name   | item_value | resource_requirement |
|-------------|------------|---------------------|
| Racing      | 28         | 393                 |
| Sports      | 69         | 195                 |
| Action      | 20         | 192                 |
| Adventure   | 62         | 155                 |
| RPG         | 58         | 500                 |
| Shooter     | 11         | 156                 |
| Strategy    | 73         | 317                 |
| Simulation  | 43         | 694                 |
| Puzzle      | 28         | 751                 |
| Fighting    | 57         | 467                 |
| Platformer  | 92         | 796                 |
| Survival    | 66         | 146                 |
| Horror      | 14         | 269                 |
