| MMO         | 12         | 652                 |

---

### Mathematical Model

**Decision Variables:**
$$
x_{ij} \in \mathbb{Z}_{\geq 0} \quad \forall i \in \{1,\ldots,10\},\ j \in \{\text{Racing}, \text{Sports}, \ldots, \text{MMO}\}
$$

**Objective:**
$$
\max \sum_{i=1}^{10} \sum_{j \in \{\text{Racing}, \ldots, \text{MMO}\}} v_j \cdot x_{ij}
$$

**Subject to:**

For each platform $i$ (resource_id):

$$
\sum_{j \in \{\text{Racing}, \ldots, \text{MMO}\}} a_j \cdot x_{ij} \leq c_i \qquad \forall i \in \{1,\ldots,10\}
$$

Where:

- $v_j$ and $a_j$ are as given in the table above for each genre $j$.
- $c_i$ is as given in the table above for each platform $i$.

**Variable Domains:**
$$
x_{ij} \in \mathbb{Z}_{\geq 0} \qquad \forall i, j
$$

